  m_text: "you need to stop the platforms in time exactly at the green mark, if you
    don\u2019t stop accurately enough, the person will fall and you will lose HP.
    Over time, the speed of the platforms increases. You also lose HP if you stop
    a platform of the wrong suit; the required suit is shown in the background. When
    you have spent all your HP, tic-tac-toe begins, if you win, you are given another
    chance."
